WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,880
Jianguo, we have to go and see

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,960
Your eldest brother-in-law has often helped us take advantage of us

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,480
You have to be conscientious

4
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:08,930
Mom, don’t worry, I understand.

5
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,330
Mom, what's wrong? Mom is too excited.

6
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:12,530
The three of you take your time with her.

7
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:17,520
I'll go over and check the situation first. Isn't that okay?

8
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:23,630
My hands are not yet good enough

9
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:24,630
What are you doing with this?

10
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,540
It's not stable and it's dangerous to be entangled.

11
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,140
Go to Lijia Village

12
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,380
My sister is still waiting for me.

13
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:35,350
It seems it’s time to buy a car

14
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:36,390
Otherwise it will be like today

15
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:37,630
to emergency

16
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:46,620
Walking takes too much time

17
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:47,540
let us in

18
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:54,500
something

19
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,460
That's what killing Yu Fu was.

20
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:56,580
Things from our Lao Li family

21
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:57,780
If you don't hand it over again

22
00:00:57,780 --> 00:00:58,860
You're welcome, ma'am.
